  maj="2026-10-19"
  answer="As soon as a load is suspended (speakers, screens, lighting trusses) or a temporary structure is built (stage, tower, grandstand), you must be able to show that it will hold: that is the role of the calculation note. The venue, the inspection body or the safety commission may ask for it. It is signed by a structural engineer; at ESE, by a partner structural engineer."
